msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 侵入者を確認・認識・該当――無し。不確定因子と認識
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_00"
msgid ""
"Intruder detected: no matching file found.\n"
"Recognized as undefined factor."
msgstr ""
"Порушника виявлено. Ідентифікація... Збігів немає.\n"
"Класифіковано як невизначений чинник."

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: ほう、貴様がもう出てきて居るか。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_01"
msgid "I didn't expect that you'd show up this early."
msgstr "О, ти вже з’явилася."

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 対象・生体反応ゼロ・存在反応・基準値の２０％・照合・照合……
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_02"
msgid ""
"Target displays no biological reaction.\n"
"Existential reaction: 20% of standard value.\n"
"Verifying... Verifying..."
msgstr ""
"Ціль: біологічна реакція відсутня. Показник присутності:\n"
"20% стандартного значення. Зіставлення. Зіставлення..."

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 未だ時間では無い筈だが。何者かが干渉して居るのか？
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_03"
msgid ""
"We should still have plenty of time.\n"
"Is anyone interrupting you?"
msgstr "Час іще не настав. Невже хтось втручається?"

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 対象を三輝神「スサノオユニット」と確認
#. JA:   ムラクモ起動・最大防御展開
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_04"
msgid ""
"Target identity confirmed: Sankishin, Susano'o unit.\n"
"Murakumo has been activated.\n"
"Preparing complete defense."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано як Санкішін — «модуль Сусаноо».\n"
"Муракумо запущено. Розгортання максимального захисту."

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 然し、如何様な事に成ろうと、貴様等は滅するのみ。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_05"
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter what you do.\n"
"This encounter will be your last."
msgstr "Та хай би що сталося, вас чекає лише знищення."

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始します
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_06"
msgid "Begin target removal."
msgstr "Розпочинаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 来い、人の造りし悪魔め！
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_07"
msgid "Whenever you're ready, demon of flesh and steel!"
msgstr "Підходь, демоне, створений людьми!"

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 機能……停止……
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_08"
msgid "A fatal...error..."
msgstr "Функціонування... припинено..."

#. Key: ArcEveHA01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 融合は未だして居ないようだな。では次は奴か。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA01_09"
msgid ""
"It would seem that the fusion has yet to begin.\n"
"Then...he must be next."
msgstr "Схоже, злиття ще не відбулося. Тоді наступний — він."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 窯が開いているだと、どういう事だ！？
#. JA:   おいテメェ、何者だ。一体何をした？
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_00"
msgid ""
"The Cauldron is open? What's going on!?\n"
"Hey, who the hell're you? What did you do?"
msgstr ""
"Котел відкритий? Якого біса?! Гей, ти хто такий? Що ти\n"
"зробив?"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 遅かったな。
#. JA:   貴様の片割なら境界の向こうにお帰り願った。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_01"
msgid ""
"You are late. I feel I should tell you... Your partner has\n"
"departed. She has gone to the far side of the Boundary."
msgstr ""
"Запізнився. Твоя друга половина вже повернулася за Межу\n"
"— я про це подбав."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: テメェが倒したのか、
#. JA:   奴を倒すのは俺の仕事なんだが、まっ、仕方ねーか。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_02"
msgid ""
"So you did her in, huh?\n"
"That was supposed to be my job, but...what the hell."
msgstr ""
"Це ти її здолав? Взагалі-то це мав зробити я, але... нічого\n"
"не вдієш."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: あい、御苦労さん。んじゃ、俺は帰るわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_03"
msgid ""
"All right, thanks for all the hard work.\n"
"Well, I'm going home then."
msgstr "Ну, дякую за роботу. Тоді я додому."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 貴様が還る所も彼処だ、黒き者よ。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_04"
msgid "The only place you'll be going, Dark One, is after her."
msgstr "І твоє місце там само, Чорний."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 何だとテメェ。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_05"
msgid "What did you say?"
msgstr "Ти що сказав, виродку?"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 成程、貴様が「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」だったか。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_06"
msgid "Aaah, yes. So this was Ragna the Bloodedge, eh?"
msgstr "Зрозуміло. Отже, ти був Раґною Бладеджем."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: ”だったか”？おい、何いってんだテメェ？
#. JA:   ワケのわかんねーことばっかいってんじゃねーよ、
#. JA:   この馬鹿が、ぶった斬るぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_07"
msgid ""
"\"Was\"? What the hell is that supposed to mean?\n"
"How 'bout you shut up before I give you another hole to\n"
"breathe out of?"
msgstr ""
"«Був»? Гей, ти що верзеш? Досить нести маячню,\n"
"придурку, бо я тебе розрубаю."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 如何した、粋がる割に足が震えて居るぞ。
#. JA:   何をそんなに怯えて居る？
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_08"
msgid ""
"What's wrong? Your legs are shaking.\n"
"What are you so afraid of?"
msgstr ""
"Що таке? Сміливця із себе корчиш, а ноги тремтять. Чого\n"
"ти так боїшся?"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 貴様は世界最強では無いのか？
#. JA:   「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」よ。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_09"
msgid "Aren't you the world's strongest, Ragna the Bloodedge?"
msgstr "Хіба ти не найсильніший у світі, Раґно Бладедж?"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 気易く呼ぶんじゃねーよ、テメェ！
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_10"
msgid ""
"A piece of shit like you shouldn't be throwing my name\n"
"around like that!"
msgstr "Не смій отак запросто називати мене на ім’я, виродку!"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: フッ、戯言は此処までとしよう、時間も無い。
#. JA:   黒き者よ、貴様の死を以って此の永き縁は潰える。
#. JA:   私の旅路も此処で終焉だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_11"
msgid ""
"It's time to stop playing games. We don't have much time.\n"
"This battle will be your end, as well as mine."
msgstr ""
"Хм. Досить нісенітниць — часу немає. Чорний, твоя смерть\n"
"покладе край цим давнім узам. І моя подорож тут\n"
"завершиться."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: あーそうかい、勝手に終わらせてろ、このお面野郎。
#. JA:   馬鹿じゃねーか、俺がここで死ぬだ？
#. JA:   ふざけんな、死ぬのはテメェだこの馬鹿が！
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_12"
msgid ""
"Yeah? How about just \"your\" end? Seriously, what kind of\n"
"idiot are you? Me, die here? Me? The only one dying here\n"
"is gonna be you, you son of a bitch!"
msgstr ""
"Ага, ясно. От і закінчуй собі що хочеш, виродку в масці. Ти\n"
"геть здурів? Я помру тут? Не верзи дурниць — тут помреш\n"
"ти, придурку!"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_13"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_14"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: ぐはあっ！……くっ……。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_15"
msgid "Argh! Guh..."
msgstr "Ґха-а! ...Кх..."

#. Key: ArcEveHA02_16
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 終わりだ、黒き者よ。
#. JA:   境界の果てで又会おう。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA02_16"
msgid ""
"It's over, Dark One.\n"
"Until we meet again...on the other side of the Boundary."
msgstr "Це кінець, Чорний. Ми ще зустрінемося на краю Межі."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: むかしむかし
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_00"
msgid "Once upon a time,"
msgstr "Давним-давно"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: まっくろな怪獣があらわれました
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_01"
msgid "there was a black beast."
msgstr "з’явилося чорне-пречорне чудовисько."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 怪獣はとてもつよく
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_02"
msgid "The beast was very strong,"
msgstr "Чудовисько було дуже сильне"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: しかも　みんなをたべてしまいます
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_03"
msgid "and it ate many people."
msgstr "і з’їдало всіх людей."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: こまった人たちは　一生懸命たたかいましたが
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_04"
msgid "The people fought the beast. However..."
msgstr "Люди були в біді й щосили билися з ним,"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: 怪獣はとてもつよく　だれもかてません
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_05"
msgid "...it was too strong, and they could not win."
msgstr ""
"але чудовисько було таким сильним, що ніхто не міг його\n"
"здолати."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: みんながこまりはてた　そのとき
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_06"
msgid "When the world was at a loss..."
msgstr "І от, коли всі вже геть зневірилися,"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_07_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: しろいお侍さんが５人のなかまをつれて
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_07_0"
msgid "...a white knight appeared out of nowhere,"
msgstr "білий самурай привів із собою п’ятьох товаришів"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_07_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: みんなのまえにあらわれました
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_07_1"
msgid "followed by five champions."
msgstr "і постав перед людьми."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: しろいお侍さんたちはとってもつよく
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_08"
msgid "They were very, very strong..."
msgstr "Білий самурай та його товариші були дуже-дуже сильні"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: とうとう怪獣をたおしてしまいました
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_09"
msgid "...and the people finally defeated the beast."
msgstr "й нарешті здолали чудовисько."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: そしてしろいお侍さんはみんなにいいました
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_10"
msgid "When the battle was over, the white knight spoke:"
msgstr "Тоді білий самурай сказав усім:"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: もうわるいことをしてはだめだぞ　と
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_11"
msgid "\"You must amend your evil ways.\""
msgstr "«Більше не робіть нічого поганого»."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: ふしぎです
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_12"
msgid "...T'was strange."
msgstr "Дивна річ."

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: わるいのは怪獣なのに
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_13"
msgid "The beast was the villain after all."
msgstr "Адже лихим було чудовисько,"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: おこったみんなは　しろいお侍さんを
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_14"
msgid "But, the people got mad at the white knight"
msgstr "але розгнівані люди схопили білого самурая"

#. Key: ArcEveHA03_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveHA_ArcEveHA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveHA.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Arcade event: Hakumen
#. JA: まっくろな扉のなかにとじこめてしまいました。
msgctxt "ArcEveHA03_15"
msgid "and locked him up in a dark room."
msgstr "і замкнули його за чорними-пречорними дверима."
